---
// Where to go next: the repository, the guide, and what isn't done yet.
---

<section class="section" id="code" aria-labelledby="code-title">
  <div class="wrap cols">
    <header>
      <h2 id="code-title">Put it in front of your own API</h2>
      <p>
        Lazaret is a TypeScript library for Cloudflare Workers. The deployment that protects
        Tidewater is one config file: which routes are held, which are reviewed inline, which
        never reach origin, and what each write touches.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div>
      <pre class="snippet"><code>{`export const config = defineLazaret({
  origin: "https://api.example.com",
  routes: [
    { match: "POST /api/login", policy: "INLINE_REVIEW" },
    { match: "POST /api/tickets", policy: "ESCROW",
      resources: ["ticket:{receipt}"] },
    { match: "* /admin/*", policy: "BLOCK" },
    { match: "GET /*", policy: "PASS" },
  ],
  review: { dailyBudgetUsd: 10 },
});`}</code></pre>
      <ul class="links sans">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/Gleato/lazaret">The repository</a>, with the library, Tidewater, the evals and this site</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/Gleato/lazaret#put-lazaret-in-front-of-your-own-api">The guide</a> to adding Lazaret to an existing API</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/Gleato/lazaret/tree/main/evals">The eval corpus and runner</a>, to check the numbers above yourself</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .snippet {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    background: var(--term);
    color: var(--term-ink);
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font: 400 0.8rem / 1.6 var(--mono);
  }
  .snippet code {
    font-size: inherit;
  }
  .links {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }
  .links li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
